<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's May C/A deficit narrows to $1.04 billion.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's May C/A deficit narrows to $1.04 billion.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's current account deficit narrowed to $1.04 billion in May from $1.59 billion a year earlier, preliminary figures released by the central Bank of Korea (BOK) showed on Friday.</p>
<p>				 May		April	  May 1996</p>
<p>    Current account   -1,038.5	  -1,713.8	 -1,592.8</p>
<p>    Trade account	 -364.3	    -798.9	   -874.5</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)     11,556.4	  11,566.0	 11,240.3</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)     11,920.7	  12,364.9	 12,114.8</p>
<p>    Invisible trade     -636.5	    -877.5	   -639.9</p>
<p>Note: figures are in millions of US dollars</p>
</text>
